              Another NO SHIT (F)ucking Replacement Door.

Forget Flist and ALL other Flist style doors they are to complex for what
should be a simple door.

all this neat util does is Look good while offering the same basic
options as the normal F command in /X u can simply replace the F
command with this as they are exactly the same Xcept u get the option
to download the listing with this util.

-------( Bad Boys )------- write silly doors that will try to send you
the Flist filelisting without ever changing its name, this is especialy
bad when u attempt to flist a listing from 2 seperate boards and get
sent the same filename, all that moving files about just cos somone
cant be arsed to write a numberbased filename changing system for the
door.
 NastyFlist encodes the date,time usernumber and filelist number into
the filename to avoid this ever happening, if you manage it it will be
a near imposibility.

Add this door in the usual way, DONT write to me asking how to do this
as if you dont know you shouldnt be running a BBS.

there are a Few variables to edit modify in the rexx all have real
variable names so u will know what to change.

TEXTACCESS={access level allowed to view online}
 Dont u hate assholes viewing all the filelistings while online, this
will set an access level for that to work,

ZOOMDIR={directory to create the filelisting in}
 Best Set to RAM: but any device path allowed

BBSPLUG={path & filname of a text file to add to the lists}
 if you dont want a list simply comment out or point this to a Non
existant file.

i think this is all u will need to know......

